{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeH3BlockCharacter","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeH3BlockCharacter","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeH3BlockRep"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.chiM_top","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.chiM_top","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3BlockCharacter.lean#L102-L107","doc":"`χ_M(σ₀σ₁σ₀) = 0` (`tr(S₀S₁S₀)`; the top word is trace-free). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.chiM_L'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.chiM_L'","kind":"theorem","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3BlockCharacter.lean#L95-L100","doc":"`χ_M(σ₀σ₁) = −1` (`tr(S₀S₁)`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.chiM_L","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.chiM_L","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3BlockCharacter.lean#L88-L93","doc":"`χ_M(σ₁σ₀) = −1` (`tr(S₁S₀)`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.chiM_sigma1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.chiM_sigma1","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3BlockCharacter.lean#L81-L86","doc":"`χ_M(σ₁) = q − q⁻¹ = h` (`tr S₁`; conjugate to `S₀`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.chiM_sigma0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.chiM_sigma0","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3BlockCharacter.lean#L76-L79","doc":"`χ_M(σ₀) = q − q⁻¹ = h` (`tr S₀`, `S₀ = diag(q, −q⁻¹)`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.chiM_gamma","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.chiM_gamma","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3BlockCharacter.lean#L72-L74","doc":"`χ_M(γ) = 2` (the identity block, `tr 1₂`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.chiM_cyclic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.chiM_cyclic","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3BlockCharacter.lean#L61-L68","doc":"**`χ_M` is a class function (cyclic).** `χ_M(u·v) = χ_M(v·u)`, from the\nmultiplicativity of the block representation (`blockOf_mulNF`) and the\ncyclicity of the matrix trace (`Matrix.trace_mul_comm`). Pure representation\ntheory — no `Fin 6` expansion. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.chiM_smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.chiM_smul","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3BlockCharacter.lean#L51-L59","doc":"`χ_M` is homogeneous. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.chiM_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.chiM_add","kind":"theorem","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3BlockCharacter.lean#L41-L49","doc":"`χ_M` is additive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.chiM","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.chiM","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3BlockCharacter.lean#L37-L39","doc":"The **2-dimensional Wedderburn character** of `H₃(q)`: the trace of the\n`(2,1)`-block seminormal representation on NF coordinates. ","signatureChunk":0}]}